WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:04.350
Some suspected you'd try to assassinate me, 
but you seem safe.

00:04.350 --> 00:07.730
I don't recall saying anything 
that would clear such suspicions.

00:07.730 --> 00:10.230
Of course you didn't. 
I'm going off my instincts.

00:10.230 --> 00:11.240
What?

00:11.570 --> 00:12.740
You've shown your colors.

00:12.740 --> 00:19.020
I mean, I doubt anyone would
accept that without more concrete proof.

00:19.020 --> 00:22.660
That's not a problem.
I possess the skill "Intuition."

00:22.660 --> 00:25.940
My hunches have never been wrong.

00:26.510 --> 00:29.110
<i>Is that how Intuition works?</i>

00:29.570 --> 00:33.270
<i>Is the Intuition skill 
enhancing her woman's intuition?</i>

00:33.270 --> 00:35.680
Well, the most decisive factor was that

00:35.680 --> 00:38.510
you possess a letter of introduction 
from the Moon Sanctum.

00:38.830 --> 00:43.930
Schnee wouldn't grant one
to anyone who'd plot an assassination.

00:43.930 --> 00:46.770
This was more like a final check.

00:46.770 --> 00:50.400
I see. So, now we get down to business?

00:50.400 --> 00:53.030
Yes. Allow me to be direct.

00:55.340 --> 00:57.790
<i>Is it marriage after all?!</i>

00:58.630 --> 01:01.540
Shin, I want you to fight me!

01:04.990 --> 01:05.770
What?

01:06.840 --> 01:10.170
Your Highness, we should discuss 
him entering our service first!

01:10.560 --> 01:14.050
What are you talking about? 
Confirming his abilities comes first.

01:14.050 --> 01:17.940
Even so, there must be a more
 delicate way to go about this.

01:17.940 --> 01:21.930
What kind of princess up and 
demands that people fight them?

01:22.360 --> 01:24.930
My sister is the ladylike one.

01:25.490 --> 01:27.310
<i>The ladylike one?</i>

01:29.660 --> 01:31.800
Now, then, let us be off.

01:31.800 --> 01:32.490
What?

01:36.080 --> 01:37.540
Y-Your Highness...

01:40.070 --> 01:41.290
You must have it rough.

01:41.290 --> 01:42.990
I appreciate your understanding.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.970
Where are we teleporting?

03:20.330 --> 03:22.220
Somewhere we can fight
to our hearts' content.

03:35.730 --> 03:37.400
What is this place?

03:37.400 --> 03:42.070
They say it was a training ground built 
for battles between chosen ones.

03:42.070 --> 03:43.240
"They say"?

03:43.870 --> 03:47.700
In truth, we don't know what 
other purposes it may have served.

03:47.700 --> 03:50.870
Teleportation points are 
pre-Dusk of Prosperity technology.

03:51.210 --> 03:54.180
We still don't fully understand them.

03:54.180 --> 03:55.540
I see.

03:56.320 --> 03:59.530
<i>I did think it was strange that they
have teleportation points</i>

03:59.530 --> 04:02.910
<i>even though teleportation is lost magic.</i>

04:02.920 --> 04:04.760
Now, let us begin.

04:05.760 --> 04:07.390
Choose whichever weapon you'd like.

04:13.460 --> 04:14.650
I'll use this.

04:14.650 --> 04:16.150
Then I...

04:18.500 --> 04:20.200
shall go with this.

04:22.040 --> 04:25.740
<i>That looks so odd in real life.</i>

04:30.580 --> 04:32.940
This battle is to test your abilities.

04:32.940 --> 04:34.920
I expect you to put in a bit of sweat.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.920
Go easy on me.

04:37.210 --> 04:38.200
Now, then...

04:38.950 --> 04:39.920
Begin!

04:50.770 --> 04:52.440
<i>She let go of her sword.</i>

04:56.350 --> 04:59.690
I thought I'd be able
 to surprise you a little.

05:00.060 --> 05:02.190
Oh, I'm plenty surprised.

05:02.190 --> 05:04.700
You say as if you didn't readily dodge me.

05:05.340 --> 05:07.200
The next one won't be so easy.

05:07.490 --> 05:10.660
<i>To fight a primarily melee-ranged 
chosen one on even terms,</i>

05:10.660 --> 05:12.950
<i>I'll adjust my stats like so.</i>

05:13.340 --> 05:15.190
Now it's my turn to attack.

05:20.820 --> 05:22.840
You'd challenge me to a contest of strength?

05:23.350 --> 05:26.090
I'm actually pretty confident 
in my physical strength.

05:30.100 --> 05:33.350
You may use skills as well. No holding back.

05:33.690 --> 05:36.000
If you insist.

05:36.670 --> 05:37.600
Flashing Vigor!

05:40.610 --> 05:41.660
Flashing Vigor!

05:43.220 --> 05:45.620
<i>They both used the same skill.</i>

05:46.080 --> 05:48.930
<i>There's hardly any difference
in the degree of enhancement.</i>

05:48.930 --> 05:51.750
<i>All that separates them now
is simple difference in ability.</i>

05:56.270 --> 05:57.260
<i>She's fast!</i>

06:03.340 --> 06:04.880
Hey, you dodged it.

06:05.550 --> 06:09.390
<i>If I hadn't, I think you'd be looking 
at a dead man right now.</i>

06:09.390 --> 06:12.510
It appears we're fighters of a similar type.

06:12.510 --> 06:14.640
Our reaction speeds are roughly the same, too.

06:14.640 --> 06:16.250
You're right.

06:16.250 --> 06:18.700
Settling this match won't be easy.

06:18.700 --> 06:20.770
Why don't we stop here?

06:20.770 --> 06:24.190
You think? I'd rather keep
 fighting a little longer.

06:24.190 --> 06:27.000
Your sword seems to be at its limit.

06:28.860 --> 06:30.780
I knew it couldn't withstand it...

06:30.780 --> 06:33.220
Your skills rival Her Highness's.

06:33.220 --> 06:35.450
On top of that,
your reaction time is impressive.

06:35.450 --> 06:37.540
This was an adequate assessment.

06:38.000 --> 06:40.510
I suppose I shouldn't force you to continue.

06:41.060 --> 06:43.790
Very well. We shall conclude our duel.

06:44.790 --> 06:47.060
<i>Thank goodness!</i>

06:50.800 --> 06:53.740
This room is off-limits. Please turn back.

06:56.760 --> 06:59.440
Shin, would you be interested in joining us?

06:59.760 --> 07:03.060
I'd feel better with you serving our kingdom.

07:03.060 --> 07:06.410
My apologies, but I'll have to pass.

07:06.410 --> 07:10.820
You wouldn't be a general, 
but I can promise you decent status.

07:11.180 --> 07:14.670
With all sorts of strings attached, no?

07:14.670 --> 07:17.080
I prefer the free life of an adventurer.

07:17.080 --> 07:20.960
I see. Let me know 
if you ever change your mind.

07:21.420 --> 07:22.960
Thank you.

07:23.680 --> 07:26.340
By the way, why do you 
have the Skullface's sword?

07:26.660 --> 07:28.810
You didn't use it when you tested me.

07:28.810 --> 07:30.420
Oh, this?

07:30.420 --> 07:32.460
In our kingdom, it's customary for a man

07:32.460 --> 07:35.480
to give a woman a sword 
when proposing marriage.

07:36.040 --> 07:39.340
She'd use it to cut him down 
if he were unfaithful.

07:39.340 --> 07:41.590
Well, that's unsettling.

07:41.590 --> 07:43.980
These days, it's just a formality.

07:43.980 --> 07:51.360
Anyway, I'd like to consider this sword that 
crashed into my bedchamber a gift from you.

07:51.360 --> 07:55.670
Wouldn't that imply I'd proposed to you?

07:55.670 --> 07:57.510
Yes, I suppose it would.

07:57.510 --> 08:01.250
It was only an accident 
that the sword went flying...

08:01.250 --> 08:05.000
I know. I won't force the matter.

08:05.000 --> 08:09.290
However, there are those plotting to leverage
this incident to arrest you as a criminal

08:09.290 --> 08:13.230
and have you gradually repay 
the kingdom through service.

08:13.230 --> 08:17.890
Well, even if it wasn't on purpose,
it easily could have killed someone.

08:18.220 --> 08:20.890
So I suggest we treat it as tribute.

08:21.180 --> 08:25.970
I see. We can treat it as tribute 
instead of a marriage proposal.

08:25.970 --> 08:29.020
That way, you're officially presented 
with a powerful weapon.

08:29.020 --> 08:32.890
And you can get the kingdom off your back.

08:32.890 --> 08:35.230
It does sound a bit forced, though.

08:35.230 --> 08:39.410
Naturally, I shall compensate him
for the blade from my own coffers.

08:39.720 --> 08:42.770
I understand that we stand to gain 
more from this arrangement,

08:42.770 --> 08:46.010
but please, allow me to keep this sword!

08:46.010 --> 08:46.890
Sure.

08:46.890 --> 08:47.540
What?

08:48.040 --> 08:53.240
All I want is to keep working 
as an adventurer as I have been.

08:53.240 --> 08:55.100
Oh, and I don't need any money.

08:55.100 --> 08:59.300
Instead, could you allow me access to the
 restricted zones of the magical library?

08:59.570 --> 09:00.830
That's all you want?

09:00.830 --> 09:05.520
This sword is worth enough for you to live
 as you please for the rest of your days!

09:05.860 --> 09:08.700
What I want right now is information.

09:08.700 --> 09:12.030
It's just that valuable to me.

09:13.220 --> 09:14.280
I see.

09:14.670 --> 09:17.860
So, do we have a deal?

09:17.860 --> 09:21.940
Of course. To tell you the truth, 
I've already used it a few times.

09:21.940 --> 09:23.540
It's starting to feel good in my hand.

09:23.940 --> 09:27.140
<i>She totally intended to make 
the sword hers from the get-go.</i>

09:37.300 --> 09:40.420
Cardinal Greril, what are you doing over there?

09:41.010 --> 09:42.810
<b>Charm IV    Confusion III</b>

09:41.010 --> 09:42.810
<b>Priest        Greril Dalles</b>

09:43.140 --> 09:45.780
This is bad! He's afflicted 
with Charm and Confusion.

09:47.070 --> 09:48.060
Stop!

09:50.030 --> 09:51.510
<i>Are we being teleported?</i>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.570
<i>But I feel sick...</i>

09:58.380 --> 10:01.230
Your Highness!

10:09.100 --> 10:12.340
Seriously? Where are we?

10:13.960 --> 10:15.270
Are you all right?

10:17.080 --> 10:18.870
What in the world happened?

10:18.870 --> 10:21.230
Seems we've been teleported somewhere.

10:22.600 --> 10:26.620
Somewhere this dilapidated, reachable 
from that teleportation point...

10:27.600 --> 10:30.600
We must be in the Holy Land, Calkia.

10:30.600 --> 10:32.580
This is the holy land?

10:32.580 --> 10:34.690
Were we the only ones teleported?

10:34.690 --> 10:38.360
Looks like it. At the very least, 
there's nobody nearby.

10:38.990 --> 10:42.600
For a priest as powerful 
as Cardinal Greril to lose his mind...

10:43.220 --> 10:45.430
What's the meaning of this?

10:45.430 --> 10:47.320
For now, let's get out of here.

10:47.320 --> 10:47.940
Right.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.250
Can you use telepathy?

10:50.250 --> 10:53.780
No. Unfortunately, 
I'm not in a party with anyone.

10:53.780 --> 10:55.860
Then I'll get in touch with mine.

10:55.860 --> 10:58.390
I'd like to tell my companions 
where to meet us.

10:58.390 --> 11:00.260
Do you know any nearby cities?

11:00.550 --> 11:03.190
There's the walled city of Valmer.

11:03.590 --> 11:07.520
You'd pass through it whether 
coming or going from Bayrelicht.

11:07.820 --> 11:08.830
Got it.

11:09.560 --> 11:10.980
Well, speak of the devil.

11:11.680 --> 11:12.430
<i>Hey, Schnee.</i>

11:12.430 --> 11:14.760
<i>Shin! Where are you?</i>

11:15.160 --> 11:18.160
<i>Are you all right?! Please respond!</i>

11:18.670 --> 11:21.030
<i>I-I'm okay, so calm down.</i>

11:21.030 --> 11:22.660
<i>I'll explain the situation.</i>

11:22.660 --> 11:24.010
<i>B-But...</i>

11:24.010 --> 11:26.910
<i>I'll say it again. I'm fine.</i>

11:26.910 --> 11:29.930
<i>V-Very well. I'm sorry.</i>

11:29.930 --> 11:34.920
<i>You disappeared so suddenly,
 I thought you'd left again.</i>

11:35.870 --> 11:38.510
<i>So, what happened?</i>

11:38.510 --> 11:40.430
<i>Well, actually...</i>

11:42.300 --> 11:43.930
<i>Charm and Confusion?</i>

11:44.170 --> 11:49.930
<i>Yeah. It's safe to assume someone 
was controlling Cardinal Greril.</i>

11:50.340 --> 11:53.790
<i>Mind-affecting skills are taboo.</i>

11:53.790 --> 11:57.710
<i>Even royals are subject to execution 
if caught with them.</i>

11:58.150 --> 12:00.440
<i>Then we have someone lurking in the shadows.</i>

12:00.720 --> 12:02.810
<i>Yes, without a doubt.</i>

12:02.810 --> 12:07.210
<i>I could just teleport out of here, 
but if I use supposedly lost magic,</i>

12:07.210 --> 12:10.220
<i>I doubt the princess and her people
 will let me go.</i>

12:10.220 --> 12:12.710
<i>I hate to ask, but could you 
handle things over there?</i>

12:12.710 --> 12:13.960
<i>That's no problem at all.</i>

12:14.320 --> 12:16.600
<i>I'll tell them the princess is safe as well.</i>

12:16.600 --> 12:18.510
<i>Where shall we meet up?</i>

12:18.510 --> 12:19.930
<i>Let's meet in Valmer.</i>

12:19.930 --> 12:21.730
<i>It's apparently a good place for that.</i>

12:21.730 --> 12:22.850
<i>Understood.</i>

12:23.190 --> 12:24.830
<i>Thanks, Schnee.</i>

12:24.830 --> 12:25.870
<i>You can count on me.</i>

12:26.850 --> 12:28.370
Master...

12:28.370 --> 12:29.740
Shin is all right.

12:29.740 --> 12:31.330
I'm so glad!

12:31.330 --> 12:32.310
Also...

12:33.210 --> 12:34.850
I have urgent business.

12:34.850 --> 12:36.610
You'll be coming with me.

12:36.950 --> 12:38.730
Urgent business?

12:39.020 --> 12:41.320
Yes. We're going to the palace.

12:44.110 --> 12:46.990
Shin has gotten caught up 
in some kind of trouble.

12:47.350 --> 12:49.780
Apparently one of <i>those</i> is behind it.

12:49.780 --> 12:51.220
One of what?

12:51.220 --> 12:52.360
A demon.

12:52.360 --> 12:53.370
A demon?

12:54.380 --> 12:56.120
I don't like those!

12:56.390 --> 12:59.750
They're monsters born from miasma, right?

13:00.110 --> 13:03.760
Yes. They're enemies who make people suffer.

13:04.320 --> 13:06.650
The chief difference between them
and other monsters

13:06.650 --> 13:09.520
is that they're empowered inside miasma.

13:09.520 --> 13:13.520
They can also disguise themselves 
as other monsters.

13:14.700 --> 13:20.160
Monsters afflicted with miasma 
indiscriminately attack creatures around them.

13:21.030 --> 13:25.150
The more humanoid a demon is, 
the more powerful and intelligent.

13:24.600 --> 13:27.740
<b>Grand Duke Class
Duke Class
Marquis Class
Count Class
Knight Class
Baron Class
Viscount Class</b>

13:25.150 --> 13:27.740
They are ranked accordingly.

13:28.140 --> 13:31.780
Because this one used skills to control a man,

13:31.780 --> 13:35.750
it's likely a relatively intelligent 
demon of the count class.

13:36.000 --> 13:38.830
And what level would that make it?

13:38.830 --> 13:44.320
Let's see... 300 at the lowest, 
400 at the highest.

13:44.320 --> 13:47.230
And it's still only a mid-rank class, huh?

13:48.080 --> 13:53.640
M-Master, I'm still not even half 
the lowest level it could be...

13:53.930 --> 13:55.500
That won't be a problem.

13:55.500 --> 13:57.640
We're just going to observe today.

13:57.640 --> 14:00.480
We're... observing?

14:07.340 --> 14:09.010
Around here should do.

14:09.510 --> 14:10.530
Hiding.

14:13.540 --> 14:15.560
A concealment spell?

14:15.560 --> 14:17.910
Don't tell me we're going to sneak in!

14:18.420 --> 14:19.790
That's exactly what we're doing.

14:19.790 --> 14:20.610
What?

14:20.610 --> 14:23.180
We're going to take a brief flight. 
Hold on tight.

14:23.180 --> 14:23.920
What?

14:24.950 --> 14:27.300
What?!

14:33.800 --> 14:35.810
Now, let's sneak into the castle.

14:36.270 --> 14:39.700
<i>Come to think of it, 
Master is pretty extreme...</i>

14:45.160 --> 14:48.820
<i>I know we're using Hiding, 
but we're walking in so brazenly.</i>

14:49.290 --> 14:52.320
Master, where are we headed?

14:52.790 --> 14:54.080
To the dungeon.

14:54.080 --> 14:56.090
Th-The dungeon?

14:59.070 --> 15:01.210
The demon has already been captured.

15:01.210 --> 15:02.100
What?

15:06.510 --> 15:07.660
Sleep.

15:15.740 --> 15:17.970
You're incredible, Master.

15:25.300 --> 15:26.760
Who's there?

15:27.230 --> 15:30.700
It's good to see you again, Cardinal Greril.

15:30.700 --> 15:32.240
Lady Raizar?

15:32.240 --> 15:33.980
What are you doing here?

15:33.980 --> 15:36.390
I heard you had Charm 
and Confusion cast on you.

15:36.920 --> 15:39.000
You know about that?

15:39.740 --> 15:44.710
I remember nothing of them being cast on me.

15:44.710 --> 15:49.560
No matter how hard I try to recall, 
all I can conjure are fragments of memories.

15:50.550 --> 15:53.360
Probably an effect of having
two mind-affecting conditions.

15:53.820 --> 15:57.260
Don't worry. The two individuals 
who were teleported are safe.

15:57.580 --> 16:00.020
What? Can that truly be?

16:00.480 --> 16:05.030
Yes, I'm certain. It won't be long 
before they return.

16:05.590 --> 16:07.900
Please accept my deepest gratitude.

16:08.670 --> 16:12.250
Now that there's nothing to worry about,

16:12.250 --> 16:15.490
why don't we dispel the status effects on you?

16:15.490 --> 16:17.280
Please do.

16:17.580 --> 16:18.340
Here we go.

16:26.880 --> 16:28.380
You've finally revealed yourself.

16:28.990 --> 16:30.800
Th-This...

16:32.380 --> 16:33.720
is the demon?

16:34.470 --> 16:36.390
<b>Count-class Demon</b>

16:34.470 --> 16:36.390
<b>Magnumuk</b>

16:36.740 --> 16:38.310
You have a name?

16:38.310 --> 16:41.890
I see. No wonder you're intelligent.

16:42.380 --> 16:46.460
A silver-haired, blue-eyed high elf...

16:46.460 --> 16:48.400
You're Schnee Raizar.

16:48.770 --> 16:52.210
It's been five hundred years 
since I've encountered one of you.

16:52.210 --> 16:54.810
I haven't seen a demon since the cataclysm,

16:54.810 --> 16:57.030
but you're as unsightly as ever.

16:57.340 --> 17:02.790
How vexing. You're always getting in our way!

17:02.790 --> 17:04.100
Of course we are.

17:12.920 --> 17:14.300
You're mine!

17:24.160 --> 17:25.190
A trifle.

17:26.230 --> 17:29.440
Why do you protect the human?

17:30.100 --> 17:33.940
Because it'd be a shame to let him die 
over these false charges.

17:34.370 --> 17:38.950
Besides, allowing you to run amok
would disgrace the Moon Sanctum.

17:38.950 --> 17:41.090
The Moon Sanctum...

17:41.090 --> 17:43.330
That's where the high human used to be.

17:43.640 --> 17:47.060
The likes of him defeated many of my kind.

17:47.060 --> 17:50.090
But that's all in the past now.

17:50.490 --> 17:51.590
You think so?

17:51.590 --> 17:55.500
Many warriors forsook this world and left.

17:55.500 --> 17:59.590
The people are still divided, 
and corruption is spreading.

17:59.590 --> 18:02.720
The age of man is ending.

18:02.720 --> 18:06.100
Schnee Raizar, join us.

18:06.620 --> 18:09.000
I was wondering what your angle was.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.610
That will never happen.

18:10.610 --> 18:14.070
Why are you so determined to scorn us?

18:14.070 --> 18:17.330
You were abandoned by your master.

18:17.330 --> 18:18.070
What?

18:19.910 --> 18:21.670
What did you just say?

18:22.340 --> 18:25.830
Your master left you behind.

18:25.830 --> 18:28.580
Much time has elapsed 
in the high humans' absence.

18:29.110 --> 18:31.100
They will never return.

18:31.100 --> 18:34.590
Do you not resent those who abandoned you?

18:35.070 --> 18:40.590
Do those who now depend 
on your power not irritate you?

18:40.980 --> 18:44.530
Ah, so you don't know after all.

18:44.530 --> 18:46.100
What are you talking about?

18:46.450 --> 18:50.030
I probably would have been angry before.

18:50.030 --> 18:53.110
Perhaps I fought based on my emotions.

18:55.220 --> 18:58.110
But you chose the most unfortunate timing.

19:02.240 --> 19:05.060
That's Blue Moon! Could it be...

19:09.060 --> 19:13.000
<i>The high humans have returned?</i>

19:17.160 --> 19:20.280
I doubt I'd even lose 
to an Elementail right now.

19:21.630 --> 19:23.950
Wow! So that's the famed...

19:24.390 --> 19:26.180
She's beautiful.

19:26.180 --> 19:28.140
But what is she doing in the castle?

19:29.440 --> 19:31.640
<i>Everyone's staring at my master!</i>

19:45.790 --> 19:47.160
Excuse me.

19:47.650 --> 19:50.160
Lady Raizar? What are you doing here?

19:50.550 --> 19:53.670
Your Majesty, I came to speak with you.

19:54.180 --> 19:58.670
I thought Cardinal Greril 
had been thrown into the dungeon.

19:58.970 --> 20:01.740
Yes. I have something to report regarding that.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.180
A demon?

20:05.590 --> 20:10.560
So the enemies of humanity 
written about in history books are active...

20:10.560 --> 20:14.180
And using taboo mind-affecting skills, too?

20:14.180 --> 20:15.690
That's a serious problem.

20:15.690 --> 20:19.630
I hope my magic can be used to resist them.

20:19.630 --> 20:21.510
I have good news as well.

20:22.680 --> 20:24.820
The two who were teleported are safe.

20:25.820 --> 20:27.670
Is that true?

20:27.670 --> 20:28.700
What a relief.

20:29.180 --> 20:33.780
I had faith that Her Highness 
and Shin wouldn't go down so easily!

20:33.780 --> 20:36.210
This is great news indeed!

20:36.210 --> 20:40.210
I'm terribly sorry for the trouble I caused.

20:40.500 --> 20:44.370
If you were under the effects
of compulsion, it is not your fault.

20:44.370 --> 20:49.970
I hope you'll continue to act 
as our liaison with the church.

20:50.230 --> 20:54.480
Certainly, sire! I vow to work 
even harder from now on.

20:54.730 --> 20:59.730
Your Majesty, word of disarray in the castle 
would unnerve the general populace.

20:59.730 --> 21:01.480
Information control is your top priority.

21:01.790 --> 21:06.740
Very well. What will you do now, Lady Raizar?

21:07.270 --> 21:09.720
There's somewhere I must go.

21:09.720 --> 21:11.030
Excuse me.

21:14.610 --> 21:17.080
E-Excuse us!

21:20.380 --> 21:23.520
Master, what are we going to do now?

21:23.520 --> 21:25.900
We're heading to the walled city of Valmer.

21:25.900 --> 21:27.900
We'll meet Shin there.

21:27.900 --> 21:32.890
But Shin has our wagon. Will we get a new one?

21:33.250 --> 21:35.890
That won't be necessary. We'll run there.

21:36.230 --> 21:37.580
Run?

21:51.700 --> 21:54.330
I'm going to increase my speed. Try to keep up.

21:54.910 --> 21:57.170
W-Wait, Master—

21:58.180 --> 22:04.360
Master, you're too fast!

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time
Episode 11
<b>The Closed Holy Land</b></b>
